note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note HOST STAND-IN device step for tests/host-trace/fakenv.om; compose after launch.om. It computes
note the VECTOR_1D result on the CPU (c = a + b mod 2^32 over gbargs 6 elements) and writes the two
note completion marks and the queue value that gblaunch checks. Not a GPU observation.
fn fkdev mark uint to void
n = ulong get gbargs 6
for i ulong n
a = mapget get gbmem 5 mul i 4 4
b = mapget get gbmem 6 mul i 4 4
r = mapset get gbmem 7 mul i 4 4 and add a b 4294967295
end
r = mapset get gbmem 3 0 4 ulong mark
r = mapset get gbmem 2 8192 4 6
r = mapset get gbmem 3 16 4 1179010630
end
